**Compare Taskip plans and choose the one that fits your business needs, team size, and workflow requirements.**

**Each plan includes essential tools for managing clients, projects, proposals, invoices, and communication from one centralized platform. As your business grows, you can upgrade your plan to access additional storage, users, workspaces, and AI capabilities.**

{% table %}
---
- **Looking to upgrade your current plan?**\
  \
  Go to your Profile and select **Billing** in your Taskip account to upgrade or manage your plan.
{% /table %}

## **Freelancer Plan**

**The Startup Team plan is ideal for small teams that need better collaboration and workflow management. It allows multiple users to work together while keeping projects, leads, and communication organized in one system.**

**This plan helps teams streamline their processes, manage clients more efficiently, and scale their operations.**

### **Plan Includes**

- **1 Workspace**
- **1 User**
- **100 GB Storage**
- **0.1M AI Tokens per month**
- **6 Packaged Services**
- **Unlimited Orders**
- **Smart Client Portal**
- **Leads and Sales Pipeline**
- **Projects & Tasks Management**
- **Proposal and Quotation Tools**
- **Invoices and Billing**
- **Support Ticketing, Chat, and Priority Support**

### **Best For**

- **Freelancers and solo professionals**
- **Consultants and independent service providers**
- **Individuals starting or growing their business**

## **Startup Team Plan**

**The Startup Team plan is ideal for small teams that need better collaboration and workflow management. It allows multiple users to work together while keeping projects, leads, and communication organized in one system.**

**This plan helps teams streamline their processes, manage clients more efficiently, and scale their operations.**

### **Plan Includes**

- **1 Workspace**
- **Up to 10 Users**
- **250 GB Storage**
- **0.5M AI Tokens per month**
- **12 Packaged Services**
- **Unlimited Orders**
- **Smart Client Portal**
- **Leads and Sales Pipeline**
- **Projects & Tasks Management**
- **Proposal and Quotation Tools**
- **Invoices and Billing**
- **Support Ticketing, Chat, and Priority Support**

### **Best For**

- **Small teams and startups**
- **Businesses collaborating on multiple projects**
- **Teams managing growing client pipelines**

## **Growing Agency Plan *(Most Popular)***

**The Growing Agency plan is built for teams that manage multiple projects and need more flexibility to scale their operations. It offers larger storage, additional workspaces, and expanded AI capabilities.**

**This plan is ideal for agencies handling several clients, projects, and workflows simultaneously.**

### **Plan Includes**

- **3 Workspaces**
- **Up to 25 Users**
- **500 GB Storage**
- **2M AI Tokens per month**
- **Unlimited Packaged Services**
- **Unlimited Orders**
- **Smart Client Portal**
- **Leads and Sales Pipeline**
- **Projects & Tasks Management**
- **Proposal and Quotation Tools**
- **Invoices and Billing**
- **Support Ticketing, Chat, and Priority Support**

### **Best For**

- **Growing agencies**
- **Teams managing multiple clients and projects**
- **Businesses scaling their operations**

## **Agency Pro Plan**

**The Agency Pro plan is designed for large teams and businesses running complex workflows across multiple workspaces. It provides maximum flexibility, unlimited users, and powerful AI capabilities to support high-volume operations.**

**This plan allows businesses to manage multiple teams, projects, and services efficiently from a centralized platform.**

### **Plan Includes**

- **5 Workspaces**
- **Unlimited Users**
- **1 TB Storage**
- **5M AI Tokens per month**
- **Unlimited Packaged Services**
- **Unlimited Orders**
- **Smart Client Portal**
- **Leads and Sales Pipeline**
- **Projects & Tasks Management**
- **Proposal and Quotation Tools**
- **Invoices and Billing**
- **Support Ticketing, Chat, and Priority Support**

### **Best For**

- **Large agencies and organizations**
- **Businesses managing multiple teams**
- **Companies handling complex workflows and high client volumes**

